# =============================================================================
# NOTES
# =============================================================================
# This .gitignore is comprehensive for the BioQL ecosystem
# If you need to track specific ignored files, use:
#   git add -f path/to/file
#
# To check what's being ignored:
#   git check-ignore -v path/to/file
